# 30-Day SQL & Data Engineering Learning Plan (Linux Edition)

This plan outlines a comprehensive, step-by-step masterclass to take you from Linux terminal basics to advanced SQL, database automation, and Data Engineering pipelines. 

## Curriculum Architecture & Progression

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
